herdbook-pane is a modified copy of the `pane` mod shipped with the Herdr
desktop app 0.1.16 (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), licensed under
the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE in this folder).

Changes from the original: main.js shows the terminal's `pane-name` label (with
fallback to Herdr 0.1.17+'s `pane.name` / `agent.pane_name`) as the pane's name;
a double-click opens herdbook-rename (or runs `pane.rename` when available), a
right-click opens herdbook-menu, a "Move to another workspace" button
(move-space.svg, added) opens its move list, and drag.js enables native and
pure-JS header drag/drop. Entries for uninstalled sibling mods don't show. Asset
paths were renamed from mods/pane/ to mods/herdbook-pane/ by Herdr's mod.clone.
